# Nightmare Zone: the lobby one step at a time, then a hard customisable rumble kept whole.
# The lobby's step follows the potions you drank in your last dreams (six overload and twenty
# absorption doses each): take what a barrel holds, buy what it lacks at the Rewards chest, top
# up the coffer for the dream you paid for last, ask Dominic for a dream, drink the potion.
# In the dream nothing is asked of you: the panel keeps the count, absorption and overload as
# figures, and learns each boss's points a kill when one leaves the arena as the count rises.
#
# Facts (OSRS wiki, Nightmare Zone; Dom Onion's Reward Shop; Absorption; Overload (Nightmare Zone);
# Potion (Nightmare Zone, dream); the potion barrels; Rewards chest; Dominic's coffer; Dominic Onion):
#  - "Custom rumble 22,000 26,000" (normal, hard); "Upon entering the dream, coins from Dominic's
#    coffer are deducted"; "Logging out while inside the arena ends the dream"
#  - "Overload (1) 1,500", "Absorption (1) 1,000" points a dose, "automatically stored in the barrels"
#  - "Each dose will absorb 50 damage ... up to 1,000 damage"; overload "Five minutes", reapplied
#    "every 15 seconds" (RuneLite's Timers and Buffs reads its varbit as refreshes 25 ticks apart)
#  - "Berserker ring (i) 650,000"
#  - barrels: super ranging 26277, super magic 26278, overload 26279, absorption 26280; Rewards
#    chest 26273; coffer 26272; the filled dream potion 26269; Dominic Onion 1120
#  - The arena is map region 9033 above the ground floor (RuneLite's Nightmare Zone plugin).
# The lobby's and arena's layouts here are schematic. The coffer varbit as thousands of coins
# and the barrel varbits are unconfirmed (see Nmz).
scene 2560 3070
at 2606 3110
skill HITPOINTS 99
object NZONE_LOBBY_CHEST 2612 3115 as chest
object NZONE_BARREL_1 2600 3118 as "ranging barrel"
object NZONE_BARREL_2 2601 3118 as "magic barrel"
object NZONE_BARREL_3 2602 3118 as "overload barrel"
object NZONE_BARREL_4 2603 3118 as "absorption barrel"
object NZONE_LOBBY_MONEYPOUCH_UNLOCKED 2609 3112 as coffer
npc NZONE_HOST "Dominic Onion" 2606 3117 as dominic
# Two kept dreams: 60,000 points in 30 minutes each, six overload and twenty absorption doses.
saved nmz.kept "1;1767000000000,3000,60000,C,H,26,w,Count Draynor|Elvarg,O6+A20;1767000003000,3000,60000,C,H,26,w,Count Draynor|Elvarg,O6+A20"
nmz reward BERSERKER_RING
varp NZONE_REWARDPOINTS 600000
varbit NZONE_POTION_3 12
varbit NZONE_POTION_4 0
varbit NZONE_CASH 20
tick
expect activity = NIGHTMARE_ZONE
expect quiet = false
expect step = "Take overload from its barrel"
expect detail = "You drink about 6 doses a dream · 12 stored"
expect object = "overload barrel"
expect stat.Points_an_hour = "120k"
# 60,000 less 9,000 for the overloads and 20,000 for the absorptions, a half hour.
expect stat.After_potions = "62k"
expect goal = "600000/650000"
expect goal.note = "50k points to go: 48m of dreams at your pace, your potions paid for (about 1 dream)."
expect pick = "1 set"
expect pick.current ~ "Hard customisable rumble 120k/h"

items INV NZONE4DOSEOVERLOADPOTION 2
tick
expect step = "Buy absorption at the Rewards chest"
expect object = chest
expect lines ~ "Overload DONE"
expect lines ~ "Absorption NEXT"

items INV NZONE4DOSEABSORPTIONPOTION 5
tick
expect step = "Put coins in Dominic's coffer"
expect detail = "Hard customisable rumble costs 26,000; it holds 20,000"
expect object = coffer

varbit NZONE_CASH 100
tick
expect step = "Ask Dominic Onion for a dream"
expect npc = "Dominic Onion"
expect detail = "Last time: hard customisable rumble, 26,000 coins"

object NZONE_LOBBY_VIAL_FULL 2606 3115 as vial
tick
expect step = "Drink the dream potion"
expect object = vial

# Into the dream: the coffer pays 26 thousand, a hard customisable rumble.
scene 2240 4672 3
at 2270 4700 3
varbit NZONE_CASH 74
varbit NZONE_CURRENTPOINTS 0
npc NZONE_ELVARG_HARD "Elvarg" 2265 4705 3 as elvarg
npc NZONE_COUNT_DRAYNOR_HARD "Count Draynor" 2275 4705 3 as draynor
tick
expect activity = NIGHTMARE_ZONE
expect step = "Hard customisable rumble"

expect quiet = true
expect target = NONE
expect stat.Dream_points = "0"
# The panel says nothing to do in a dream.
never verb != "Dreaming"
never quiet = false

# A dose of each: drunk, not told to.
items INV set NZONE4DOSEOVERLOADPOTION 1 NZONE3DOSEOVERLOADPOTION 1 NZONE4DOSEABSORPTIONPOTION 4 NZONE3DOSEABSORPTIONPOTION 1
varbit NZONE_ABSORB_POTION_EFFECTS 250
varbit NZONE_OVERLOAD_POTION_EFFECTS 20
tick
expect gauge.Absorption = "250/1000"
expect gauge.Overload = "300/300"
expect lines ~ "Overload IDLE"
expect lines ~ "Absorption IDLE"
expect lines ~ "Elvarg IDLE"

# Elvarg leaves the arena as the count rises: 2,400 points a kill, learnt.
remove elvarg
varbit NZONE_CURRENTPOINTS 2400
tick
expect stat.Dream_points = "2,400"
expect lines ~ "Elvarg DONE"
# Count Draynor leaves; the count rises three ticks later.
remove draynor
tick 3
varbit NZONE_CURRENTPOINTS 5000
tick
expect stat.Dream_points = "5,000"
expect lines ~ "Count Draynor DONE"
# Reward points: the dream's count is held with them while the chest has not had it.
expect stat.Reward_points = "605k"
tick 100
expect stat.Dream_pace ~ "k"

# Awake in the lobby: the dream is kept, the points at the chest.
forget
scene 2560 3070
at 2606 3110
object NZONE_LOBBY_CHEST 2612 3115 as chest
npc NZONE_HOST "Dominic Onion" 2606 3117 as dominic
varp NZONE_REWARDPOINTS 605000
tick
expect quiet = false
expect saved.nmz.kept ~ ",5000,C,H,26,w,Count Draynor|Elvarg,O1+A1"
expect saved.nmz.kills = "1;H|Count Draynor|1|2600;H|Elvarg|1|2400"
expect stat.Reward_points = "605k"
expect supply.headline = "Best dream: 60k points"
expect pick = "1 set"
